{"bg_img":"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/uploadfile\/image\/20250123\/20250123094610_32881.png","category_id":"6a157626b0cd2e35d86fcf74","column_id":"6a154fc77093015d5705df9a","create_time":"2025-01-23 09:43:40","details":"<h3>\r\n\t<img src=\"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/uploadfile\/image\/20250123\/20250123094458_11801.jpg\" alt=\"mPEG-NPC\" width=\"500\" height=\"250\" =\"mPEG-NPC\" align=\"\" \/>\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<h3>\r\n\t一、基本信息\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t\t英文名称：mPEG-NPC，mPEG-Nitrophenyl Carbonate\r\n\t<\/li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t\t中文名称：甲氧基-聚乙二醇-硝基苯基碳酸酯\r\n\t<\/li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t\t分子量：根据PEG链的长度不同，mPEG-NPC的分子量有多种规格可选，如1k、2k、3.4k、5k、10k、20k等，且可根据需求进行定制。\r\n\t<\/li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t\t外观：粘稠液体或固体粉末，具体形态取决于分子量大小。\r\n\t<\/li>\r\n<\/ul>\r\n<h3>\r\n\t二、官能团介绍\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<p>\r\n\tmPEG-NPC的核心官能团是硝基苯碳酸酯（NPC）基团。这一官能团赋予了mPEG-NPC独特的化学性质和应用价值。\r\n<\/p>\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t硝基苯碳酸酯（NPC）基团：\r\n\t\t<\/p>\r\n\t\t<ul>\r\n\t\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t\t\t反应性：NPC基团在适当的条件下可以与氨基（-NH2）发生反应，形成稳定的酰胺键。这种反应性质使得mPEG-NPC成为一种重要的氨基反应性PEG衍生物。\r\n\t\t\t<\/li>\r\n\t\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t\t\tpH敏感性：NPC基团在特定的pH范围内（如6.5至9.5）表现出较高的反应活性，这有利于在温和的条件下进行化学修饰。\r\n\t\t\t<\/li>\r\n\t\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t\t\t应用：由于NPC基团的反应性，mPEG-NPC可用于修饰蛋白质、肽或任何其他在赖氨酸残基或N末端带有可用氨基的表面。这种修饰可以提高生物分子的稳定性、溶解性或降低其免疫原性。\r\n\t\t\t<\/li>\r\n\t\t<\/ul>\r\n\t<\/li>\r\n<\/ul>\r\n<h3>\r\n\t三、应用与用途\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<p>\r\n\tmPEG-NPC在生物医学、材料科学和化学合成等领域具有广泛的应用前景。\r\n<\/p>\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t\t生物医学：mPEG-NPC可用于制备PEG修饰的生物分子，如PEG修饰的蛋白质、抗体等。这些修饰后的生物分子具有更好的药代动力学性质和更低的免疫原性，从而提高了药物的疗效和安全性。\r\n\t<\/li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t\t材料科学：mPEG-NPC可用于制备PEG修饰的材料表面，以改善材料的生物相容性和抗污性能。这种修饰后的材料在生物医学植入物、组织工程等领域具有潜在的应用价值。\r\n\t<\/li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t\t化学合成：mPEG-NPC的NPC基团可以与含有氨基的分子发生反应，形成新的化学键。这种反应性质为化学合成提供了新的途径和方法。\r\n\t<\/li>\r\n<\/ul>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<p font-size:14px;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" text-wrap-mode:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; border-style: none; border-color: inherit; border-width: 0px; list-style-type: none; color: rgb(9, 9, 9); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei-Regular&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-wrap-mode: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>产品技术优势<\/strong><\/span>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p font-size:14px;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" text-wrap-mode:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; border-style: none; border-color: inherit; border-width: 0px; list-style-type: none; color: rgb(9, 9, 9); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei-Regular&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-wrap-mode: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">赛诺邦格提供高质量PEG衍生物，具有产品结构新颖多样，取代基团丰富，端基取代率高等特点。\r\n\t<\/p>\r\n<p font-size:14px;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" text-wrap-mode:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; border-style: none; border-color: inherit; border-width: 0px; list-style-type: none; color: rgb(9, 9, 9); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei-Regular&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-wrap-mode: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<ul font-size:14px;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" text-wrap-mode:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-style: none; border-color: inherit; border-width: 0px; list-style-type: none; color: rgb(9, 9, 9); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei-Regular&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-wrap-mode: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\r\n<li>\r\n\t高PEG官能团含量-含量可高达99%\r\n<\/li>\r\n\t<\/ul>\r\n<blockquote font-size:14px;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" text-wrap-mode:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(9, 9, 9); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei-Regular&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-wrap-mode: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\tPEG的官能化，是PEG产品中最有难度的。市场上主要产品存在的普遍问题是官能团含量不高。而我们掌握的修饰技术、引发体系、非常规沉淀法和系统萃取法等技术和工艺可以轻松制得高官能团含量的产品。大部分产品的官能团含量可达99%，比对手的90%左右高得多。\r\n\t<\/p>\r\n\t\t<\/blockquote>\r\n<p font-size:14px;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" text-wrap-mode:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; border-style: none; border-color: inherit; border-width: 0px; list-style-type: none; color: rgb(9, 9, 9); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei-Regular&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-wrap-mode: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br \/>\r\n\t\t\t<\/p>\r\n<ul font-size:14px;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" text-wrap-mode:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-style: none; border-color: inherit; border-width: 0px; list-style-type: none; color: rgb(9, 9, 9); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei-Regular&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-wrap-mode: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\r\n\t\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t\t\t高质量PEG分子量控制-PDI &lt;1.05\r\n\t\t\t<\/li>\r\n\t\t\t\t<\/ul>\r\n<blockquote font-size:14px;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" text-wrap-mode:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(9, 9, 9); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei-Regular&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-wrap-mode: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t聚合物的单分子链通常来说是由许多小分子重复单元通过聚合的方法连接而得。合成方法的设计和控制对实现单个高分子链段的长度，以及多个聚合物链段的长度相似程度有至关重要的影响。我们的PEG合成技术能保证非常好的分散度（PDI&lt;1.05)，而许多其他 公司的产品一般PDI仅在1.1左右。\r\n\t\t\t\t<\/p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<br \/>\r\n\t\t\t\t<\/p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/blockquote>\r\n<h3 class=\"Editable-styled\" background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" text-wrap-mode:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 14px; border-style: none; border-color: inherit; border-width: 0px; list-style-type: none; color: rgb(9, 9, 9); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei-Regular&quot;; text-wrap-mode: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span>相关推荐：<\/span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/h3>\r\n<div class=\"TableToolbar-container\" font-size:14px;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" text-wrap-mode:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-style: none; border-color: inherit; border-width: 0px; list-style-type: